// Hand-written 7-2 content: the audition room (Future Hot Shots Talent Agency's casting office, a real place in Mark's story) with the tape position T that drives every
// camera dolly, lift and light batten, the REW / FF / PLAY pads on the floor, the monitor wall that plays Mark's tapes, the ghost audition on the upper deck, the
